dict(i=8, title="CLIAVE Team Came Together in Belgrade", body=[
"We had our 4th transnational project meeting in Belgrade, Serbia from October 23rd to 24th. The meeting brought together partners from five different countries who are working on the project \"Climate Focused Agricultural Vocational Education\". The main objectives of the meeting were to review the progress of the project activities, share best practices and challenges, and plan the next steps for the implementation and dissemination of the project results. The meeting was a valuable opportunity for networking, learning and collaboration among the project partners.",
"We would like to thank our Serbian partner for hosting the meeting and organizing everything so well. We look forward to continuing our work on this important project and meeting again in the next transnational project meeting."]),
dict(i=9, title="Industrial Sustainability and Green Transformation Workshop", body=[
"The Industrial Sustainability and Green Transformation Workshop was held on 12–14 October at Bilecik Şeyh Edebali University. The event was attended by approximately 200 people and simultaneously broadcast online on screens installed on the university campus. A poster presentation was made by project partner Assoc. Prof. Dr. Burçin Atılgan Türkmen from Bilecik Şeyh Edebali University to promote the project."]),
dict(i=10, title="ErasmusDays 2023 Celebrated in Yalova", body=[
"ErasmusDays, which has been organized by Erasmus+ since 2018 and took place between 9–14 October 2023 this year, was celebrated in Yalova. The Turkish National Agency is the manager of the programme in Türkiye. A meeting was organized by the Atatürk Horticultural Central Research Institute in Yalova on October 12, 2023. In this meeting, the project \"Climate Focused Agricultural Vocational Education (CLIAVE)\" was introduced and a seminar presentation on the \"Interaction of Soil and Climate Change\" was made. TEMA Foundation Yalova Provincial Representation and volunteers attended the seminar as listeners.",
"Project Coordinator Dr. Erdinç Uysal was the speaker of the seminar. The possible effects of agricultural activities and land use changes on greenhouse gas emissions that cause climate change were discussed and the importance of soil in carbon storage was emphasized. At the end of the seminar, information was given about the CLIAVE project. It was stated that climate is the most important determinant of agricultural production and that the project aims to contribute to the education of agricultural workers who provide guidance and consultancy to farmers and of students studying agriculture. The meeting ended with the introduction of the project partners to the participants."]),
dict(i=11, title="ErasmusDays 2023 Celebrated in Bilecik", body=[
"Within the scope of the ErasmusDays programme, an event was organized for students by our project partner Bilecik Şeyh Edebali University on Wednesday, 11 October 2023. The meeting was attended by 62 students. Project coordinator Dr. Erdinç Uysal and project partners Assoc. Prof. Dr. Burçin Atılgan Türkmen and Levent Burgu from Bilecik Şeyh Edebali University made presentations about the Erasmus programme and the CLIAVE project.",
"After the presentations, a question-and-answer session was held and participants' questions about the Erasmus programme and the project were answered."]),
dict(i=12, title="CLIAVE at the 14th International Symposium \"Modern Trends in Livestock Production\"", body=[
"The Institute for Animal Husbandry organized the 14th International Symposium \"Modern Trends in Livestock Production\" on October 4–6, 2023. The event was attended by over 40 foreign participants from 23 countries. Dr. Dušica Ostojić Andrić, leader of the Serbian CLIAVE project team, presided over the section where works on climate change in animal husbandry were presented. Dr. Ljiljana Samolovac, an associate of the CLIAVE project, presented a paper on cattle production in conditions of climate change. The constructive discussion that followed concluded that although animal husbandry contributes significantly to GHG emissions, there are various measures that can be applied to mitigate its impact on climate change."]),
dict(i=13, title="CLIAVE at the ISAS 2023 International Symposium – Panel Discussion on the Impact of Animal Production on the Environment", body=[
"As part of the ISAS 2023 international symposium, held from September 18–20, 2023 at the Faculty of Agriculture in Novi Sad, a panel discussion was held on the topic \"Impact of animal production on the environment\". Panel participants, including Dr. Ljiljana Samolovac as a representative of the Institute and the CLIAVE project, tried to answer some of the so-called \"hot topic\" questions regarding animal husbandry and the environment, such as: What is the actual impact of animal husbandry on the environment with reference to Serbia? Which impacts of livestock production on the environment stand out as the most important? What is the connection between climate change and livestock production? How important is the presence of cattle for the preservation of natural habitats and the vitality of the existing vegetation? What do farmers think about climate change? What should we do? Through the discussion of panellists – eminent experts from agricultural, technological, natural sciences and other faculties, institutes, meat processing plants and food producers – the current situation and potential future scenarios were presented to the media and the general public."],
 links=[["Recording of the panel discussion (YouTube)","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bDe7f3LZQ54&list=PLFsek8RSx4nDRFKTaA97LphHFFvDO2bqd&index=4"],["Panel website","https://www.isasevent.com/panel-discussions/impact-animal-production-on-environment"]]),
dict(i=14, title="Promotional Event Organized in Yalova", body=[
"A promotional event was held for student interns at the Atatürk Horticultural Central Research Institute who study at universities in different provinces of Türkiye. After giving a presentation on \"Climate Change and Its Effects on Agriculture\", Dr. Erdinç Uysal gave information about CLIAVE and encouraged the students to use the training modules of the project in the future."]),
dict(i=15, title="CLIAVE at the 1st Regional Group Meeting", body=[
"Dr. Erdinç Uysal made a presentation about the CLIAVE project and project promotion materials were distributed to the participants at the 1st \"Regional Group Meeting\", where the completed and ongoing projects of the Institute were presented.",
"The 1st Regional Group Meeting of 2023 was held on 22 June 2023 in the Prof. Dr. Sabahattin Özbek Meeting Hall of the Institute, with the participation of the Bartın, Bursa, Düzce, Kocaeli, Sakarya, Yalova and Zonguldak Provincial Directorates of Agriculture and Forestry, Bandırma Sheep Breeding Research Institute, Sakarya Maize Research Institute, Bursa Central Research Institute of Food and Feed Control and several professional organizations."],
 links=[["The meeting in the local press (Yalova Gazetesi)","https://www.yalovagazetesi.com/1bolge-grup-toplantisi-yapildi"]]),
dict(i=16, title="CLIAVE at the Nature, Science, Art and Sports Festival", body=[
"Yalova Municipality and TEMA (The Turkish Foundation for Combating Soil Erosion, for Reforestation and the Protection of Natural Habitats) jointly organized the second \"Nature, Science, Art and Sports Festival\" on 10–11 June 2023. Citizens showed great interest during the two days of the festival, which also included topics such as climate change and biodiversity. The CLIAVE project team took part in this event by distributing brochures and providing detailed information about the project to those who were interested."]),
dict(i=17, title="Information Meeting Held in Yalova", body=[
"Dr. Erdinç Uysal made a 40-minute presentation introducing the CLIAVE project and climate change within the scope of a training programme organized at the Atatürk Horticultural Central Research Institute on 2 June 2023."]),
dict(i=18, title="CLIAVE at the 90th International Agricultural Fair in Novi Sad", body=[
"Livestock Breeders' Day at the 90th International Agricultural Fair in Novi Sad provided an excellent opportunity to introduce the CLIAVE project and its preliminary findings to agronomists, agriculture students and breeders. On this occasion, Dr. Dušica Ostojić Andrić gave a presentation on animal husbandry and climate change in which the project's first results were disseminated. A lively discussion followed, demonstrating how popular this topic is among professionals."]),
dict(i=19, title="CLIAVE Team Came Together in Maribor", body=[
"The transnational project meeting that took place in Maribor, Slovenia from April 4th to 5th was a great success. The meeting brought together partners from five different countries who are working on the project \"Climate Focused Agricultural Vocational Education\". The main objectives of the meeting were to review the progress of the project activities, share best practices and challenges, and plan the next steps for the implementation and dissemination of the project results. The meeting was a valuable opportunity for networking, learning and collaboration among the project partners.",
"We would like to thank our Slovenian partner for hosting the meeting and organizing everything so well."]),
